<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARLOVY VARY, Czech Republic 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Czech Open women's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) beat Lenka Cenkova (Czech Republic) 5-7 7-6 (7-3) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>5-Ruxanda Dragomir (Romania) beat 4-Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) 6-0 6-7 (5-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Final:</p>
<p>5-Ruxanda Drogomir (Romania) beat Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) 6-2 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Doubles final:</p>
<p>Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)/Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) beat Eva Martincova (Czech Republic)/Elena Wagner (Germany) 3-6 6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
